     </draw:image>
    </draw:frame>Moringa Oleifera is a plant native to subtropical regions that contains over 90 essential nutrients in a well-balanced manner. It is also called the &quot;Miracle Tree,&quot; &quot;Tree of Life,&quot; and &quot;Medicine Box Tree.&quot; <text:span text:style-name="T3">It </text:span>is the ultimate superfood left to humanity to supplement modern nutritional deficiencies.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2">The ancient Indian medical text &quot;Ayurveda&quot; states that it is effective in preventing over 300 types of diseases. Useful components are contained in all parts of the plant: leaves, flowers, pods, seeds, bark, and stems.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="P1" text:outline-level="1">Spreading the Power of The Miracle Tree: </text:h>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:span text:style-name="T2">Moringa</text:span> × Hot Bath Therapy Nationwide</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2">I am Mizuguchi, the Representative Director of the Japan Moringa Steaming Association.</text:p>
