     </draw:image>
    </draw:frame>Although the superfood &quot;Moringa&quot; has gradually become known in Japan in recent years, I became captivated by its charm even before it became famous and went to study in America and the Philippines.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2">I want to spread nationwide the message that it is necessary in modern society to absorb Moringa&apos;s nutrition not only internally but also externally.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2">Furthermore, I chose the association format because I wanted to energize the entire industry through Moringa steaming by connecting with salon owners who previously had almost no horizontal connections.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2">If you would like to experience Moringa steaming, please contact <text:span text:style-name="T5">our certified salons nationwide.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2">We are still recruiting salons for introduction.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2">Let&apos;s expand the circle of Moringa together!</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_1" text:outline-level="1">What is <text:span text:style-name="T2">Moringa</text:span> Steaming?</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2">Moringa steaming is a hot bath therapy using steam from steamed leaves of the &quot;Miracle Tree&quot; Moringa. In contrast to its aromatic green tea-like scent that creates a relaxed and calm atmosphere, you can experience amazing effects in less than 5 minutes: sweat pouring from your pores, <text:soft-page-break/>incredible detoxification, skincare benefits, diet support, relief from gynecological concerns, fertility support, and increased basal body temperature.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2">Moringa steaming is recommended for everyone who wants to improve their constitution, but our association&apos;s original Moringa steaming menu &quot;JMSA Moringa Steam&quot; is especially recommended for the following people:</text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="L2">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P3"><text:span text:style-name="T1">For Those Trying to Conceive: While mugwort steaming is famous for fertility support, it can actually only be offered for half the month to those trying to conceive. Moringa steaming can be safely offered anytime - even during pregnancy. Some clients have come for warming treatments until the day before delivery!</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P3"><text:span text:style-name="T1">For Those with Hay Fever or Atopy: The most common feedback from customers who have continued Moringa steaming for several years is: &quot;I feel like my hay fever symptoms have eased compared to last year!&quot; You can detox thoroughly and achieve smooth, beautiful skin. It&apos;s also popular among those with atopy.</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P3"><text:span text:style-name="T1">Diet Support: Although you&apos;re just sitting during Moringa steaming, you can actually burn calories equivalent to 3 hours of aerobics. If you&apos;re troubled by swelling, please try it right away. The amino acid power contained in Moringa may also help?!</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_1" text:outline-level="1">Those Who Experienced <text:s/><text:span text:style-name="T2">Moringa</text:span> Steam</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2">Better than any herb I&apos;ve tried before!!</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2">This is amazing! Even though my body was cold, I immediately broke into a heavy sweat, and after about 20-30 minutes, my skin started to become smooth. Even after finishing, the sweat wouldn&apos;t stop and changing clothes was difficult (laughs). Better than any herb I&apos;ve tried before!!</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2"/>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_1" text:outline-level="1">Introduction to Certified Salons</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2">Our association&apos;s Moringa steaming can be experienced at certified esthetic salons, relaxation salons, chiropractic clinics, and acupuncture clinics nationwide. <text:span text:style-name="T5">Please find a store near you.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">(Some salons are still being prepared for listing. If there are no nearby stores, please contact us.)</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"><text:s text:c="4"/>• aesthetic salon Laguna</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Lymph &amp; Detox Salon Lu・cuore</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Esthetic Salon Celestia</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Total Healthcare salon Nilufa</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Yomogi &amp; Moringa Steam Warming Salon Ananta</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Organic &amp; Detox salon Beloved</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"><text:s text:c="4"/>• EMIE</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"><text:soft-page-break/>Furthermore, our association&apos;s direct &quot;JMSA Moringa Steam®&quot; can be experienced at salons with Moringa Steam Therapists</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_1" text:outline-level="1">For Those Considering Introducing <text:span text:style-name="T2">Moringa</text:span> Steaming</text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2">Fortunately, in recent years, awareness of Moringa steaming has increased in the industry, and it has become easier to obtain Moringa as a seat bath agent than before.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2">However, learning at our association, which started Moringa steaming for the first time in Japan, and introducing Moringa steaming ensures overwhelming specialized knowledge and continuous after-sales support. Above all, we provide food-grade Moringa leaves that have obtained organic certifications both domestically and internationally, so we guarantee that you can confidently offer it to your customers.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2">We have prepared four courses optimal for your purpose, from courses that can be easily introduced to <text:span text:style-name="T5">business opening schools</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P2"/>
  </office:text>
 </office:body>
</office:document>